      "message": "QQ: Does this callback thread, which is binder, has same priority that of writer\u0027s thread in the framework? I assuming the writer\u0027s thread is URGENT_AUDIO.\n\nEven if it is has same priority, this  ```mCommandReplyLock``` access is not guaranteed here or rather i can say it is not serialized. Thus, it end up waiting for sometime. In our stability testing, this happened to Audio HAL.",
